<title>SINGAPORE: Metro sees difficult retail conditions.</title>
<headline>Metro sees difficult retail conditions.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stores group Metro Holdings Ltd said on Friday it expected recent difficult retail conditions to continue.  </p>
<p>Metro said in a statement with its first-half financial results that it expected its property division to show a slight improvement in its contribution to the group results during the rest of the current year.</p>
<p>But it added:</p>
<p>&quot;The competitive market conditions experienced by the retail division (are) exected to prevail.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
